# Premium Frontend UI

Craft exceptional UI for the Factorial webpage (`webpage/`). This skill is about
the invisible details: the 50ms delay that makes a button feel satisfying, the
spring curve that makes a dropdown feel physical, the typographic rhythm that
makes a page feel authoritative.

**Stack:** Next.js 15 · Tailwind CSS 3 · Framer Motion · GSAP · DM Sans font

---

## The Standard

Ask this about every detail: **would a user notice if it were gone?**

If yes — keep it and do it right.
If no — cut it. Invisible complexity is debt.

---

## Hero Architecture

Every hero needs three layers working together:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│  BACKGROUND LAYER                   │  z-0: image, video, gradient, texture
│  CONTENT LAYER                      │  z-10: headline, subtext, CTA
│  DEPTH LAYER (optional)             │  z-5: parallax overlay, grain, blur
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Hero template

```tsx
'use client'
import { motion } from 'framer-motion'

// Word-level stagger for hero headlines
function AnimatedHeadline({ text }: { text: string }) {
  const words = text.split(' ')
  return (
    <h1 className="text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5rem)] font-bold leading-tight">
      {words.map((word, i) => (
        <motion.span
          key={i}
          className="inline-block mr-[0.25em]"
          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: '1em', clipPath: 'inset(0 0 100% 0)' }}
          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, clipPath: 'inset(0 0 0% 0)' }}
          transition={{
            duration: 0.6,
            delay: 0.1 + i * 0.07,
            ease: [0.23, 1, 0.32, 1],
          }}
        >
          {word}
        </motion.span>
      ))}
    </h1>
  )
}

export function HeroSection() {
  return (
    <section className="relative min-h-[100dvh] flex items-center">
      {/* Background */}
      <motion.div
        className="absolute inset-0 z-0"
        initial={{ scale: 1.05 }}
        animate={{ scale: 1 }}
        transition={{ duration: 1.4, ease: [0.23, 1, 0.32, 1] }}
      >
        {/* image or video */}
      </motion.div>

      {/* Content */}
      <div className="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6">
        <AnimatedHeadline text="Your compelling headline here" />
        <motion.p
          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
          transition={{ duration: 0.6, delay: 0.5, ease: [0.23, 1, 0.32, 1] }}
          className="mt-6 text-xl"
        >
          Supporting copy
        </motion.p>
        <motion.div
          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
          transition={{ duration: 0.5, delay: 0.7, ease: [0.23, 1, 0.32, 1] }}
          className="mt-10"
        >
          {/* CTA button */}
        </motion.div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )
}
```

