## Fluid Typography

```css
/* DM Sans, fluid scale */
.hero-heading {
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw + 1rem, 6rem);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.section-heading {
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw + 0.5rem, 3.5rem);
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.015em;
}
```

Tight line-height (`1.05–1.15`) for large headings feels premium.
Loose line-height (`1.6–1.8`) for body text improves readability.

