## The Details That Matter

These are the differences between "looks nice" and "feels premium":

| Detail | Implementation |
|--------|----------------|
| Button active state | `scale(0.97)` on `:active` — feels tactile |
| Link underline | Custom `background-size` animated underline, not `text-decoration` |
| Card hover | `translateY(-4px)` + subtle shadow increase — 200ms ease-out |
| Image load | Blur-up placeholder → full resolution (avoid layout shift) |
| Focus ring | Custom ring matching brand color — never `outline: none` alone |
| Number animation | Count-up on scroll enter (use `useMotionValue` + `animate`) |
| Empty states | Illustrated, not just text. Still animates in. |
| Error states | Color + icon + message — never just red text |

