## Factorial Webpage Context

- **Font:** DM Sans — always. Never system fonts.
- **Colors:** `radical` for primary CTAs, `neutral` for everything else, `viridian`/`sunbeam`/`tangerine`/`jade` as accent
- **Animation libraries:** Framer Motion (installed), GSAP (installed), Lottie (installed)
- **Breakpoints:** 375px / 768px / 1440px (test all three)
- **Locales:** en-US baseline, es-ES ~20% longer — test text overflow on premium layouts
- **Formatting:** OxFmt (single quotes, no semicolons, 2-space indent)
